Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.03,0:04:17.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll be able to complete my field research.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.03,0:04:17.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我就可以完成我那领域的研究了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.55,0:04:19.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And there will be an article about me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.55,0:04:19.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后我就可以在《古生物学刊》里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.60,0:04:21.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}in the Paleontology Review.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.60,0:04:21.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}发表我的论文了
