Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.90,0:04:30.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you talking about the Dewer Grant?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.90,0:04:30.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等  你是说杜瓦补助金
