Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.50,0:07:08.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}里面有我拍过的所有广告
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:10.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Joe-- - Just watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:10.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-乔伊...  -你就看一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.24,0:07:11.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you don't like it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.24,0:07:11.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.12,0:07:13.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}don't pass it on to your bosses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.12,0:07:13.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就别给你上司就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:15.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Fine. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:15.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好吧  -谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.03,0:07:22.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Work, Joe. - Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.03,0:07:22.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-工作啦  乔伊  -可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.06,0:07:27.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What am I gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.06,0:07:27.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该怎么办啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:28.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just pass the tape along.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:28.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就给你上司看看咯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:30.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's not right for the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:30.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的确不适合演这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.52,0:07:31.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I suggest him,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.52,0:07:31.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我推荐他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:33.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}my bosses will think I'm an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:33.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的老板会觉得我是个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.23,0:07:35.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that's something they should learn on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.23,0:07:35.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望我的老板能迟些才发现这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:38.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just tell Joey that you watched the tape...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:38.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就告诉乔伊你看过带子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.47,0:07:40.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you liked it, but your bosses didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.47,0:07:40.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你很喜欢  但你的老板们不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.64,0:07:41.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then that way, you're the good guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.64,0:07:41.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那样  你就成了好人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.97,0:07:43.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and they're the bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.97,0:07:43.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}坏人就是你的老板啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:45.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's good. I liked it, they didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:45.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好主意  我喜欢  老板不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.06,0:07:50.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey, for God's sake, go to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.06,0:07:50.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  看在上帝份上  去工作啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.99,0:07:59.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe I'm about to meet Benjamin Hobart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.99,0:07:59.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不敢相信我马上就要见到本杰明·哈伯特
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.23,0:08:01.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've always thought of him as someone I'd invite...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.23,0:08:01.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一直以为
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.35,0:08:04.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to my fantasy dinner party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.35,0:08:04.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有在梦中才能和他共聚晚餐呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.21,0:08:06.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think there's any chance
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.21,0:08:06.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他会不会带上一些
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:08.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}he'll bring Christie Brinkley or C-3PO?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:08.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他喜欢的小玩偶来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.55,0:08:12.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry, it looks like it's just him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.55,0:08:12.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起  看来他是自己来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.76,0:08:16.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.76,0:08:16.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}查莉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:22.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My God, you look absolutely stunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:22.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  你简直太美了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.63,0:08:25.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I am having a good hair day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.63,0:08:25.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗  今天我特地去了理发
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.62,0:08:29.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- It's so good to see you. - Oh, you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.62,0:08:29.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-见到你真好  -我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:39.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. Ross Geller, Benjamin Hobart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:39.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起...罗斯·盖勒  本杰明·哈伯特
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:41.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's an honor to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:41.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很荣幸见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.18,0:08:43.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't tell you how long...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.18,0:08:43.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我仰慕你都不知道多久了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.33,0:08:47.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I've been an admirer of your work. I mean, that Nobel Prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.33,0:08:47.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说  你得了诺贝尔奖  喔...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:51.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, I have to tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:51.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不得不对你说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:53.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that you're one of the reasons I got into the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:53.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是我进入这个领域原因之一
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.29,0:08:55.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.29,0:08:55.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗  我也久仰大名
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.54,0:08:58.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually not likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.54,0:08:58.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实没有久仰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.43,0:09:00.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd never heard of you until this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.43,0:09:00.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我今早才第一次听到你的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:01.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But it's nice to be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:01.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但为人随和没什么不好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.78,0:09:06.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Shall we? - Yeah. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.78,0:09:06.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们坐  -好的  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.10,0:09:13.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe that you chose this restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.10,0:09:13.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不敢相信你选了这个餐馆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.79,0:09:15.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you remember the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.79,0:09:15.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还记得那天晚上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:17.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. I completely forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:17.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢天啊  我完全忘记了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.92,0:09:22.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, I can't believe they let us back in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.92,0:09:22.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  真不敢相信他们能让我们进门
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:31.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You weren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:31.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你当时不在场
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.31,0:09:36.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, but, you know, it's just a funny image.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.31,0:09:36.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是不在  但想想都好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.67,0:09:41.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, the two of you in this restaurant with the....
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.67,0:09:41.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想想你们两个  在这个餐馆  还...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.69,0:09:45.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, why don't you tell Benji
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.69,0:09:45.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  我去洗手间的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.93,0:09:48.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}about your proposal while I go to the ladies' room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.93,0:09:48.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟本杰说说你的方案吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.62,0:09:52.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.62,0:09:52.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来吧  告诉我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:56.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Well, I would like to do a dig in the Painted Desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:56.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会在彩色沙漠里进行挖掘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:10:00.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are still several areas that haven't been fully excavated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:10:00.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为里面有些地区还没完全挖掘
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.59,0:10:01.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Break up with Charlie. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.59,0:10:01.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-和查莉分手吧  -什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.95,0:10:02.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.95,0:10:02.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.50,0:10:08.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you just say, "Break up with Charlie"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.50,0:10:08.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你刚才说  "和查莉分手"吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.79,0:10:11.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, yes and no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.79,0:10:11.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以说是  也可以说不是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:14.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I did say it. And no, I didn't not say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:14.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是  我是这样说了  不是的话就是说我没有不说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.99,0:10:18.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kind of inappropriate, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.99,0:10:18.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不觉得这么说有点不妥吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.27,0:10:20.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.27,0:10:20.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:21.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just haven't seen her for so long,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:21.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我太久没有见她了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:23.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}all these feelings are rushing back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:23.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以前的感觉又涌上心头
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.78,0:10:24.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm starting to realize
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.78,0:10:24.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我意识到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.80,0:10:26.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}how much I've missed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.80,0:10:26.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有多想念她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.47,0:10:28.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'm gonna need you to break up with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.47,0:10:28.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我需要你和她分手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:32.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:32.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.52,0:10:33.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you say, yes, then I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.52,0:10:33.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你说行  那我就是认真的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:35.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you say, no, then I'm joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:35.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你说不行  那我就是开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.48,0:10:39.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No. - Joking it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.48,0:10:39.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不行  -我开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.63,0:10:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.63,0:10:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨  对不起  我迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.13,0:10:46.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, how'd it go with Mike?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.13,0:10:46.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿  和迈克谈得怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.59,0:10:47.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is he gonna let you keep the painting?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.59,0:10:47.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他肯让你保留那幅画吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.01,0:10:50.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, he really hates it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.01,0:10:50.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行  他实在很讨厌它
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.61,0:10:53.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But he's gonna let me keep my box of human hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.61,0:10:53.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他肯让我留下我那盒头发
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.84,0:10:56.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you gotta pick your battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.84,0:10:56.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我只能妥协了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.31,0:11:00.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But the good news is, Gladys is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.31,0:11:00.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但好消息是  格拉达斯已经属于你了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.01,0:11:03.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, what's the bad news?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.01,0:11:03.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那坏消息呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.93,0:11:06.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who's Gladys?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.93,0:11:06.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁是格拉达斯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.19,0:11:08.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, she's that work of art I made.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.19,0:11:08.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她是我的手工作品
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:10.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, with the woman coming out of the frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:10.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是女人从相框里出来的那幅
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:14.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And Monica gets to keep her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:14.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给莫尼卡了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.85,0:11:19.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In her house? I am so jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.85,0:11:19.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放在她房间里  羡慕嫉妒恨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.89,0:11:23.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't know you wanted her too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.89,0:11:23.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道你也想要她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:28.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I mean, sure, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:28.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我...当然想要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.09,0:11:31.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you already gave that to Monica, so....
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.09,0:11:31.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但...你已经给了莫尼卡了  所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.44,0:11:33.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I would give her up for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.44,0:11:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为了你  我可以放弃她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.61,0:11:35.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I couldn't let you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.61,0:11:35.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行  我不可以让你这样做的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.16,0:11:37.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No, but I want to. - But I don't want you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.16,0:11:37.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-但我想这样做  -但我不想你这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.74,0:11:41.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- But I insist. - But I insist harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.74,0:11:41.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-但我坚持  -但我更坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.48,0:11:46.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Girls. Girls. Stop. Okay, we'll flip a coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.48,0:11:46.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}女生们  停一停好吗  我们投硬币决定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.15,0:11:47.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Heads, she's Rachel's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.15,0:11:47.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}正面  她是瑞秋的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.16,0:11:48.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tails, she's Monica's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.16,0:11:48.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反面  她就是莫尼卡的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.74,0:11:53.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tails. Monica, she's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.74,0:11:53.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反面  莫尼卡  她是你的了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.61,0:11:55.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, that landed in your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.61,0:11:55.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行  它掉到你的食物里了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.64,0:11:57.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.64,0:11:57.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.78,0:12:00.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You won fair and square. I'm so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.78,0:12:00.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你赢得光明正大  我太难过了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.08,0:12:05.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.08,0:12:05.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿  乔伊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.14,0:12:06.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What's up? - Bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.14,0:12:06.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么事  -坏消息
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.87,0:12:07.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I watched the tape
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.87,0:12:07.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看过了带子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.73,0:12:09.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and passed it along to my bosses
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.73,0:12:09.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}并把它交给我的老板们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.09,0:12:10.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and they weren't interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.09,0:12:10.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他们不感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.71,0:12:14.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.71,0:12:14.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起  老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:18.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you watched the tape?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:18.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但...你看过这带子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.58,0:12:20.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.58,0:12:20.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  我...我很喜欢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.08,0:12:24.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But my bosses didn't go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.08,0:12:24.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但...我的老板不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.61,0:12:26.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stupid sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.61,0:12:26.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些愚蠢的狗杂种
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.14,0:12:33.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You didn't watch the tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.14,0:12:33.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没有看过这带子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:36.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? Of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:36.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  我当然看啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.47,0:12:38.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, it's one thing not to cast me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.47,0:12:38.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不推荐我是一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.62,0:12:39.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but to lie to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.62,0:12:39.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你对我说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:41.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not lying to you. I watched it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:41.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有说谎啊  我看了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.74,0:12:43.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You lied again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.74,0:12:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看  又说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:46.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I watched it. - Keep going, Pinocchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我看了  -继续说谎吧  匹诺曹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.39,0:12:49.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I did. - No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.39,0:12:49.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我看了  -没有  你没看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:51.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm telling you, I watched the tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:51.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我告诉你  我看了这带子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.42,0:12:55.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Did you watch the tape? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.42,0:12:55.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你看过这带子吗  -没有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.69,0:13:01.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. The selection committee has chosen
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.69,0:13:01.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}评选委员会选出
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:03.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the three of you as our finalists.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:03.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们三人于今天作最后评核
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.28,0:13:05.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The ultimate decision will be based on the answers
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.28,0:13:05.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最终决定会基于
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.12,0:13:07.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you give to the questions I ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.12,0:13:07.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们如何回答我的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.17,0:13:08.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're gonna go ahead and start with Dr. Li.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.17,0:13:08.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先从李博士开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.86,0:13:11.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Li, you claim the field is too reliant
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.86,0:13:11.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}李博士  你提出学界
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.05,0:13:13.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}on the Linnaean taxonomic system.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.05,0:13:13.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太依赖林奈分类系统
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.34,0:13:15.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do you propose to correct this problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.34,0:13:15.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你打算怎么解决这个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.52,0:13:16.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I believe that the answers
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.52,0:13:16.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我相信解决办法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:18.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}lie in the osteological evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:18.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在骨骼证据上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.79,0:13:20.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I plan to begin there. - Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.79,0:13:20.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我打算从那里入手  -很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:22.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:22.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:26.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Biely, your proposal includes some fieldwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:26.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}白莉博士  你的方案有一些挖掘工作
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.47,0:13:27.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where might that take place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.47,0:13:27.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会选择哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.75,0:13:30.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Primarily in the Pierre Shale region of South Dakota.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.75,0:13:30.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}首先是南达科他州的皮尔页岩地区
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.63,0:13:32.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Certainly. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.63,0:13:32.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然  很好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.55,0:13:35.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And Dr.Geller, when is my birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.55,0:13:35.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那盖勒博士  我生日是什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.46,0:13:42.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? I--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.46,0:13:42.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  我...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.34,0:13:46.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Care to venture a guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.34,0:13:46.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不能猜一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.08,0:13:53.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- May 12? - That's not even kind of close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.08,0:13:53.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-5月12号  -还差很远呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.22,0:13:57.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Li, how many graduate students you'd be needing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.22,0:13:57.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}李博士  你需要多少个研究生呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.56,0:13:58.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Half a dozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.56,0:13:58.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}六个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.45,0:13:59.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see. And Dr. Biely?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.45,0:13:59.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}明白了  那白莉博士呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:02.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Three for excavation, and two for analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:02.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}三个负责挖掘  两个负责分析
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.25,0:14:06.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Certainly. Dr. Geller, which 1965 Shirelles hit...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.25,0:14:06.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然  盖勒博士  1965年沙伦斯乐队
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.53,0:14:09.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...was later covered by a popular British Invasion band?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.53,0:14:09.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}被哪支英国乐队盖过风头
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.11,0:14:15.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? I need six graduate students.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.11,0:14:15.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么...  我需要六个研究生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.01,0:14:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.01,0:14:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是  对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.09,0:14:18.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We were looking for "Baby It's You."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.09,0:14:18.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}答案是  "宝贝  就是你"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.86,0:14:21.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Baby It's You."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.86,0:14:21.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"宝贝  就是你"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:25.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? Wait just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:25.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么...  等等  等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.27,0:14:28.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}None of my questions have anything to do with paleontology.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.27,0:14:28.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的问题没有一条是关于古生物学的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:29.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right, I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:29.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错  我该道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.63,0:14:31.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Scratch the last question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.63,0:14:31.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那最后一条问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.07,0:14:33.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Spell "Boscodictiasaur."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.07,0:14:33.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拼写单词"Boscodictiasaur"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.76,0:14:39.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've never heard of a "Boscodictiasaur."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.76,0:14:39.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有听过这个单词啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.26,0:14:41.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I just made it up. Spell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.26,0:14:41.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是  我乱编的单词  快拼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.53,0:14:46.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. B-O-S-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.53,0:14:46.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的  B...O...S...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.63,0:14:48.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it starts with a silent M.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.63,0:14:48.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  开头有个不发音的"M"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.06,0:14:49.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.06,0:14:49.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.35,0:14:59.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.35,0:14:59.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不敢相信乔伊这么说我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.20,0:15:00.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hate being called a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.20,0:15:00.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我讨厌被人称为骗子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:02.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you are a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:02.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你就是个骗子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.07,0:15:05.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did I just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.07,0:15:05.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚刚怎么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.31,0:15:08.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.31,0:15:08.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.32,0:15:09.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. And I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.32,0:15:09.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的  而且我不得不说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.46,0:15:11.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'm not just hurt, I'm insulted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.46,0:15:11.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不仅仅是受伤害  我感觉被侮辱了一样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.91,0:15:13.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I tell somebody I did something--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.91,0:15:13.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当我说我已经做了某事...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.72,0:15:15.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, hold on, let me just stop you right there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.72,0:15:15.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了好了...  我打断你一下好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.53,0:15:17.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}First, you lied. Right?
