Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.17,0:19:40.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- She's mine. - She's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.17,0:19:40.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-她是我的  -是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.84,0:19:42.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- She's mine. - She's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.84,0:19:42.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-她是我的  -她是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:45.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys, you don't have to fight over her anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:45.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们啊  不用为她争吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.53,0:19:47.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whoever doesn't get Gladys,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.53,0:19:47.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁得不到格拉达斯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:49.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}gets Glynnis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:49.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就把格林妮斯拿回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.89,0:19:59.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I want Gladys. - She's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.89,0:19:59.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我要格拉达斯  -她是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:02.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- She's mine. - She's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:02.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-她是我的  -她是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:08.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. Look, I'm sorry I didn't give them your tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:08.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很抱歉我没有把你的带子给他们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:10.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I promise next time to submit you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:10.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我保证  下次无论合不合适
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.57,0:20:12.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}whether I think you're right or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.57,0:20:12.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我都会把你推荐上去的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:14.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's not the point, Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:14.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}重点不是这个啊  钱德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:15.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The point is that you lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:15.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}重点是  你说了谎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.89,0:20:17.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.89,0:20:17.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道  你说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.86,0:20:20.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's it gonna take for you to forgive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.86,0:20:20.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要做什么你才能原谅我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.54,0:20:22.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.54,0:20:22.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢  天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.96,0:20:27.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.96,0:20:27.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}绝了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.89,0:20:30.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.89,0:20:30.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在你该说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:33.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lying is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:33.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说谎是不对的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:36.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And? And?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:36.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有呢...  还有呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.11,0:20:39.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm a pretty little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.11,0:20:39.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是个漂亮美眉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.59,0:20:43.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.59,0:20:43.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我早就知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.73,0:20:54.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your ex-boyfriend is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.73,0:20:54.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的前男友是个疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.51,0:20:56.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you get the grant?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.51,0:20:56.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}随便啦  你得到那笔资金了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.47,0:20:58.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. And you wanna know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.47,0:20:58.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有  你想知道为什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.27,0:21:01.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because your ex-boyfriend is still in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.27,0:21:01.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你的前男友还是爱着你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.89,0:21:02.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.89,0:21:02.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么  -没错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:03.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He wouldn't give me the grant,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:03.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他没有给我那笔补助
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.60,0:21:05.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because I wouldn't give you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.60,0:21:05.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就因为我没有放弃你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.51,0:21:07.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Benji isn't in love with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.51,0:21:07.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}本杰不会还爱着我的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.19,0:21:08.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, he broke up with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.19,0:21:08.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为当时是他抛弃我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.99,0:21:11.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And besides, he's a very ethical man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.99,0:21:11.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且  他是个很有道德的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.26,0:21:12.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.26,0:21:12.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.13,0:21:17.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it ethical to ask someone in a grant review:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.13,0:21:17.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在面谈中问这种问题
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.22,0:21:19.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Who was the voice of Underdog?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.22,0:21:19.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《超狗任务》中谁给狗配音
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.85,0:21:21.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sure he was just joking, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.85,0:21:21.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我肯定他是在开玩笑  罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.54,0:21:23.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you don't believe me, let's go talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.54,0:21:23.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你不相信我  我们去找他对质吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.60,0:21:24.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm telling you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.60,0:21:24.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.39,0:21:27.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}he didn't ask me one paleontological question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.39,0:21:27.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他没有问过我一个关于考古学的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.17,0:21:27.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.17,0:21:27.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.01,0:21:30.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'm sorry. No, he did ask me one:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.01,0:21:30.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦  不是  他问了我一个
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.27,0:21:32.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"How do you spell Boscodictiasaur?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.27,0:21:32.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么拼"boscodictiosaur"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.76,0:21:35.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, if it's like the Lake Mbosco in Congo,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.76,0:21:35.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和刚果的巴斯克湖拼法一样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.08,0:21:36.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}then M-B-O--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.08,0:21:36.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是M...B...O...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.29,0:21:37.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.29,0:21:37.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.32,0:21:44.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Geller. Charlie, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.32,0:21:44.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}盖勒博士...  查莉  你们到这来干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.59,0:21:46.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want you to tell her everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.59,0:21:46.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要你告诉他一切
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.75,0:21:48.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}About the deal you tried to make with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.75,0:21:48.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉他你想和我做的交易
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.63,0:21:50.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}about the crazy questions you--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.63,0:21:50.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那些神经病的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.83,0:21:55.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wally Cox. That's the voice of Underdog.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.83,0:21:55.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}沃利·考克斯  他就是《超狗任务》的配音
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.70,0:21:58.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like I tried to tell you in the interview...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.70,0:21:58.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就如之前的调查我告诉你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.85,0:22:00.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...this grant is not based on
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.85,0:22:00.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这笔资金不是为了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.58,0:22:02.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}your knowledge of pretty useless trivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.58,0:22:02.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些无聊的知识而设的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.98,0:22:04.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.98,0:22:04.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  不  不  别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.63,0:22:06.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want you to look her in the eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.63,0:22:06.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要你看着她的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.56,0:22:07.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and tell her the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.56,0:22:07.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉她真相
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.39,0:22:10.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Benji?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.39,0:22:10.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}本杰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.59,0:22:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.59,0:22:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的  的确是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.05,0:22:14.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I behaved horribly,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.05,0:22:14.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我之前简直是乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.33,0:22:16.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but it's only because I still love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.33,0:22:16.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但这都是因为我还爱着你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.50,0:22:17.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I would do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.50,0:22:17.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要你回到我身边
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:19.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to have you back in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:19.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以做任何事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.45,0:22:21.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Too little, too late, Benji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.45,0:22:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早干嘛去了  本杰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.34,0:22:25.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.34,0:22:25.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.34,0:22:27.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I never should've broken up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.34,0:22:27.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真不应该离开你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.63,0:22:29.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think about you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.63,0:22:29.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我无时无刻不在想你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.92,0:22:32.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you ever still think about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.92,0:22:32.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道你就从来没想过我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.90,0:22:34.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.90,0:22:34.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.29,0:22:36.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yes. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.29,0:22:36.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有  -什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.33,0:22:40.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know what to say, Benji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.33,0:22:40.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道该说什么好了  本杰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.43,0:22:41.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is all so...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.43,0:22:41.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这一切实在太...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.39,0:22:44.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.39,0:22:44.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}浪漫了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:46.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:46.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或者...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.23,0:22:51.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know I may be way out of bounds here...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.23,0:22:51.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道  或者我做得太过火了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.75,0:22:54.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but is there any chance you would take me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.75,0:22:54.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们还有机会在一起吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.79,0:22:59.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.79,0:22:59.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或者可以...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.12,0:23:01.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sweetie, this conversation is starting to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.12,0:23:01.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甜心  你们的对话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.80,0:23:03.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}make me a little uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.80,0:23:03.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我觉得有点不舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.71,0:23:09.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God. I am so sorry, but--
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.71,0:23:09.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  我很抱歉  但...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.49,0:23:13.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, there's so much history between us, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.49,0:23:13.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说...我们之前有太多的过去了...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.50,0:23:16.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.50,0:23:16.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也觉得抱歉...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.07,0:23:26.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.07,0:23:26.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.28,0:23:28.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.28,0:23:28.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.86,0:23:33.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, that's it, we are seeing other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.86,0:23:33.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧就这样  我们都可以找下家了
